---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION, BOOKING_URL } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Clinical Myotherapy in Melbourne's inner north</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				Hi, I'm James Maddock — Clinical Myotherapist and Remedial Massage Therapist,
				practising at The Urban Alchemist in Carlton North. I've spent nearly two decades
				working with bodies, and in 2026 completed a Bachelor of Health Science
				(Clinical Myotherapy) to deepen how I assess, treat, and help you recover.
			</p>
			<h2>How I work</h2>
			<p>
				My approach starts with the nervous system. Everything I do — hands-on treatment,
				movement, education, even the way we talk about what's going on — is ultimately
				received, integrated, and processed by your nervous system. My job isn't to "fix"
				you. It's to create the right conditions for your own capacity to heal to work
				as well as it possibly can.
			</p>
			<p>That means three things in practice:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<strong>Assessment before treatment.</strong> Orthopaedic and neurological
					testing to work out what's actually driving your pain, not just where it hurts.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Pain is data.</strong> Pain doesn't always equal damage. Understanding
					what your pain means — and what it doesn't — is often the turning point in
					recovery.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Meeting you where you are.</strong> Treatment paced to your readiness,
					not a protocol. Advancing, pausing, or stepping back are all valid clinical choices.
				</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>What I can help with</h2>
			<p>
				Persistent and recurring musculoskeletal pain, headaches, postural and overuse
				conditions, surgical recovery and lymphatic support, joint stiffness, sporting
				and workplace injuries, and building strength and confidence in movement again.
			</p>
			<p>
				<a href="/services">Read more about my services</a>,
				<a href="/what-is-myotherapy">find out what Clinical Myotherapy actually is</a>, or
				<a href="/about">get to know me and my approach</a>.
			</p>
			<p class="cta-wrap">
				<a class="cta-button" href={BOOKING_URL} target="_blank">Book Now</a>
				<span class="cta-caption">Secure online booking with Cliniko.</span>
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
